 "remarks": "Charming and well-maintained 2-bedroom, 1-bath first-floor ranch condo in an ideal Norwalk location! This spacious home features an open floor plan, combining the dining and living rooms, which leads to a deck with serene wooded views. Enjoy modern comforts including central air, vinyl plank floors, recessed lighting, and an updated kitchen with quartz countertops and stainless steel appliances, self-closing drawers, under-cabinet lighting, and crown molding. Enjoy the added benefits of a one-car garage with reserved parking, and a large private storage room. Located just a short distance from the train station on Glover Avenue and easy access to major highways and shopping. This condo provides an unbeatable combination of comfort and convenience. Don't miss the opportunity to make this your new home!",
